  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252f6ghz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pachadotdev/buymeacoffee-badges/main/bmc-black.svg\" alt=\"贊助我\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>坦克船</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/dqf94vyckp50yw0ohxsu4/r.png?rlkey=1w29drk0cgo454dh301cafwj9&st=oujarwn7&raw=1\" alt=\"需要\"> <a style=\"text-decoration:none !important\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/ws960ahfkhfqnrsqkcilv/et.png?rlkey=w8fujlhdtt9tn57trnqkgi039&st=8hm018ks&raw=1\" alt=\"ETF\"> </a> <img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/sw5siw0xwrg7prx9mb192/plus.png?rlkey=0pavr0l7p8vkwrdcyi56lqoir&st=lxg7yir9&raw=1\" alt=\"加上\"> <a style=\"text-decoration:none !important\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/prngjz65opz5l54kfy39z/e.png?rlkey=harnv3pqnasrdl3a3bk47s205&st=umph0hff&raw=1\" alt=\"EMF\"> </a>或 <a style=\"text-decoration:none !important\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/thfwderk9tgm9yzq281jx/optifine.jpg?rlkey=l89bglqjt5ixh9lqj1unk547a&raw=1\" alt=\"OptiFine\"> </a></p>\n<p>將原版船替換為簡單的坦克風格載具。</p>\n<p><strong>需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> + <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a> 來支援自訂模型。</strong></p>\n<h2>授權與使用條款</h2>\n<p>保留所有權利 (ARR)</p>\n<p>✅ 允許個人使用。</p>\n<p>✅ 允許於影片與直播中使用。不強制要求署名，但若能註明將不勝感激。</p>\n<p>❌ 禁止重新發布。</p>\n<p>❌ 修改後的版本亦不得重新發布。</p>",
